cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Modular ROS 2 Framework for End-to-End Evaluation of Onboard Vision Pipelines"
abstract: >-
  A modular ROS 2 framework for evaluating onboard robot vision pipelines end to end on
  edge hardware. Object detection, visual SLAM, and visual servoing can each be swapped
  with a single argument, and the framework measures what changes across the whole
  pipeline — per-stage latency, control-loop rate, and closed-loop mission outcome —
  rather than in isolation. Evaluated on a Raspberry Pi 5 with a Hailo-10H NPU against a
  hardware-in-the-loop Simulink simulator.
